==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|kröte|lang=gmh}}, {{term|krotte|lang=gmh}}, {{term|krot|lang=gmh}}, {{term|krete|krëte|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|krota|lang=goh}}, {{term|kreta|lang=goh}}, {{term|chrota|lang=goh}}, {{term|chreta||toad|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*krudō}}, {{m|gem-pro|*kredō||toad}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*guredʰ-||toad}}. Cognate with Middle Low German {{term|krode|krōde|toad|lang=gml}}.

